  + [fixture_case_present] is FFX-008-contradicted-support
  + [fixture_case_present] is FFX-009-ambiguous-identity
  + [fixture_case_present] is FFX-010-blocked-output
  + [fixture_case_present] is FFX-011-fault-output
  + [index_present] is docs/fixtures/Foundation_Fixture_Index.v1.sop
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is executable test harness implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is generated SQLite database files
